message: >-
  If you use these computational materials, please cite them as below, and
  cite the book they accompany (see preferred-citation).
type: software
title: >-
  Computational Materials for Scientific Machine Learning: Mathematical
  Foundations, Methods, and Limitations
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Alsammani
    given-names: Abdallah A.
    affiliation: Department of Mathematical Sciences, Delaware State University
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, experiment configurations, stored numerical results, figure scripts and
  reproducibility documentation for the book "Scientific Machine Learning:
  Mathematical Foundations, Methods, and Limitations".
keywords:
  - scientific machine learning
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - operator learning
  - inverse problems
  - uncertainty quantification
  - numerical analysis
  - reproducibility
